  "_THRESHOLD_NOTE": "play_vitality was 0.6. English is vowel-dense, so vitality cleared that threshold for most words and the fallback classified 72% of unknown words as 'play', saturating the DEL dimension and pinning every conversation to the AERIE zone. Measured over a 16-line corpus: at 0.6 the fallback claimed 38% of all words with a 72% play share; at 0.95 it claims 12% with an 11% play share, DEL stops saturating, and zone distribution balances across THE_FORGE/AERIE/THE_MUD. See ROADMAP A5 and tools/audit_physics_inputs.py. heavy_density was 0.55 and inherited the same skew once play was fixed (72% of fallback verdicts). Raised to 0.70, which keeps plosive-density as a real signal while leaving the fallback a minor contributor; 0.85 removes the heavy verdict entirely, which is too aggressive."
